  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1aa042d7-3e08-4c80-a366-e1c6d2bf4a87-9894890.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 197px;\" /></p><p>The position of first minima is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;is height of the point from the axis passing through the mid-point of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>)</p><p>Since the first minima is in front of the slit as shown in the figure,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>D</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>800</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math></p>",
